# --- Local AI inference (CPU-only for maximum hardware compatibility) ---
# Plain CPU Ollama. GPU backends (vulkan/cuda/rocm) produced corrupted
# token-salad output on some integrated GPUs — a 0.5B model runs fine on CPU
# in a few seconds and is deterministic on ANY machine, which is the whole
# point of this distro. No GPU driver lottery, no troubleshooting.
ollama

