# --- Audio (voice module) ---
# sof-firmware + alsa-ucm-conf are CRITICAL: every Intel laptop from ~2019 on
# (the exact machines normies install on) needs Sound Open Firmware + UCM
# profiles or the INTERNAL MIC is never detected. linux-firmware alone is not
# enough. alsa-firmware covers older Creative/emu cards.
alsa-utils
alsa-ucm-conf
alsa-firmware
sof-firmware
pipewire
pipewire-alsa
pipewire-pulse
wireplumber

# --- SSL / Web management ---
certbot
apache
nginx


